{"task":"transcribe","language":"en","duration":52.1301875,"text":"Here is the free AI system that makes it so that I never have to check my email inbox again. So at the beginning of the day, my AI agent sweeps through all of my emails, sorts them based on sender, and then routes them to their own specific folders. Each email gets its own folder. Each category of emails has its own folder that the agents decide. So I have my clickup, I have my receipts, I have my to-do lists, I have my inbound leads, and this loops until it hits zero. Then for all the newsletters that I get, some of which I've intentionally subscribed to, the agent can examine the content. Then for every email that is classified as spam, it automatically unsubscribes using this tool right here. Then it sends me a report directly to my phone so I can review what's actually important. Now if you want to see how to build this out for yourself, just comment system down below.","words":null,"segments":[{"avg_logprob":-0.10001196814097947,"compression_ratio":1.7849056603773585,"end":2.56,"id":1,"no_speech_prob":0.008982280269265175,"seek":0,"start":0.0,"temperature":0.0,"text":" Here is the free AI system that makes it","tokens":[50364,1692,307,264,1737,7318,1185,300,1669,309,50492],"words":null},{"avg_logprob":-0.10001196814097947,"compression_ratio":1.7849056603773585,"end":6.08,"id":2,"no_speech_prob":0.008982280269265175,"seek":0,"start":2.56,"temperature":0.0,"text":" so that I never have to check my email inbox again.","tokens":[50492,370,300,286,1128,362,281,1520,452,3796,35067,797,13,50668],"words":null},{"avg_logprob":-0.10001196814097947,"compression_ratio":1.7849056603773585,"end":7.18,"id":3,"no_speech_prob":0.008982280269265175,"seek":0,"start":6.08,"temperature":0.0,"text":" So at the beginning of the day,","tokens":[50668,407,412,264,2863,295,264,786,11,50723],"words":null},{"avg_logprob":-0.10001196814097947,"compression_ratio":1.7849056603773585,"end":9.72,"id":4,"no_speech_prob":0.008982